        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo HR-110, 4 Inch Hinge Mounting Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMounting plate for 4\" high hinge. For use with steel doors or steel door frame. Standard 4 inch hinge template screw pattern. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/4-1-2-inch-hinge-reinforcement-plate-don-jo-hr-120\"><b>4-1/2 Inch Hinge Mounting Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-HR-110_size.gif?v=1704354561\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo HR-110 4 Inch Hinge plate size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUse when existing mounting is missing, damaged or new 4\" hinge installation. Plate can be attached with screws, welding or rivets to the inside of steel door or frame. Hinge mounting holes are tapped for #12-24 hinge screw.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the HR-110 4 Inch Hinge Mounting Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Offset: 3/32\" (for standard weight .134\" thick hinge)</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 7 Gauge (.179\")</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/HR-110.pdf?v=1704262280\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo HR-110 Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
